-**Parameters:**
-- **Kernel Size:** Fixed to 3x3x3 (26 neighbors) [S2, unofficial].
-- **Weighting:** Uniform weight for all visible neighbors [S2, unofficial].
-- **Darkening Strength:** Fixed at 0.5 (max 50% darkening) [S2, unofficial].
